# order-management-model

## Order Status Flow
- Initial: PENDING
- Post-Payment: PROCESSING
- Kitchen Accepted: IN_PREPARATION 
- Ready: READY_FOR_PICKUP
- Completed: COMPLETED
- Cancelled: CANCELLED

## Core Order Processing Pipeline
1. Order Creation
- Validates menu items and prices
- Applies Geneva-specific tax rate (7.5%)
- Generates restaurant metadata
- Creates unique order ID with SC prefix
Importance Score: 85

2. Status Management
- Multi-stage order tracking
- Custom order queue management
- Real-time status updates
- Restaurant-specific order workflow
Importance Score: 75

3. Notification Workflow
- Multi-channel alerts (email, SMS)
- Restaurant-formatted order details
- Custom notification templates
- Status change triggers
Importance Score: 75

## Data Model Components
1. Order Entity
- Order ID (SC prefix format)
- Status (enum of valid states)
- Line Items (menu items + quantities)
- Tax Amount (Geneva rate)
- Pickup Time
- Customer Details

2. Status Transitions
- PENDING → PROCESSING (payment complete)
- PROCESSING → IN_PREPARATION (kitchen accept)
- IN_PREPARATION → READY_FOR_PICKUP (food ready)
- READY_FOR_PICKUP → COMPLETED (customer pickup)
- Any State → CANCELLED (cancellation)

## Business Rules
1. Orders require validation against current menu prices
2. Tax calculations specific to Geneva, NE
3. Status changes trigger corresponding notifications
4. Pickup times must be during business hours

